  "notes": "Takes the pattern A⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|まさ}る (A surpasses B). Often used in written or somewhat formal contexts. The opposite is ⟦{劣|おと}る→劣る：02025_otoru⟧ (to be inferior).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- A⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|まさ}る — A surpasses B\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|まさ}る⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦{劣|おと}らない→劣る：02025_otoru⟧ — at least as good as, no less than\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {何|なに}に⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{勝|まさ}る — surpassing everything, above all else\n- ⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|まさ}る — beyond words\n- ⟦{数|かず}→数：00204_kazu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|まさ}る — superior in numbers\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{優|すぐ}れる→優れる：02119_sugureru⟧ — to excel, to be outstanding\n- ⟦{超|こ}える→超える：01942_koeru⟧ — to exceed, to surpass (more general, less literary)",
